## Summary

I shipped a production-polished, parity-faithful native Apple SwiftUI port of `LiveStateIndicators` (web → Apple), following the established per-surface architecture, and committed it (`b7a2aeff2`).

**Surface (7 files, `apps/apple/TeslaSync/feature-views/LiveStateIndicators.*`):**
- `.swift` — entry view, `surfaceSlug`, phase switch
